    "text": "By WBBJ 7 Eyewitness News Staff ,\n4 hours ago MADISON COUNTY, Tenn. — According to his family, former Madison County Commissioner James Fuller has died. An obituary listing by Mercer Brothers Funeral Home in Jackson says fuller died in Middle Tennessee following a lengthy illness last month. His family says he served as a Madison County Commissioner in... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
